# Version-control only scripts and parameters: the 00–08 Rmds, render_all.R, run_gate_evidence.R, the R/ helper library, and config/.
# Script products (rds, outputs, etc.) and everything else are untracked; to track a new file, add an allow rule here.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/*.Rmd
!/render_all.R
!/run_gate_evidence.R
!/R/
!/config/
